            "displayName": "Sam Berlin",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "That makes sense -- I agree that interrupting is a bad practice.  I'll take another stab at it tomorrow... (or feel free to do it in the meantime).",
